  "title": "Karen&#39;s Fried Green Tomatoes",
  "description": "These fried green tomatoes without cornmeal are lightly seasoned with flour and pan-fried to perfection in butter for a delicious Southern delicacy.",
  "authors": [
    "Brandi Rose"
  ],
